<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional"><xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_AcidGlands"]</xpath><nomatch><li Class="PatchOperationAdd"><xpath>/Defs</xpath><value><VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_EvolutionGene"><defName>VRE_AcidGlands</defName><label>acid glands</label><description>Carriers of this gene develop acid glands, enabling them to spew acid from their neck, damaging buildings, people and items in a targeted area.</description><unlockable>false</unlockable><iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_AcidGlands</iconPath><displayOrderInCategory>1006</displayOrderInCategory><abilities><li>VFEI2_InsectAcidSpew</li></abilities><selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight><exclusionTags><li>InsectorGlands</li><li>InsectorMouth</li></exclusionTags><symbolPack><prefixSymbols><li><symbol>acid</symbol></li><li><symbol>veno</symbol></li></prefixSymbols></symbolPack><modExtensions><li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension"><backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathEndogenes><backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathXenogenes></li></modExtensions></VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef></value></li></nomatch></Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional"><xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_InfraredSensors"]</xpath><nomatch><li Class="PatchOperationAdd"><xpath>/Defs</xpath><value><VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_EvolutionGene"><defName>VRE_InfraredSensors</defName><label>infrared sensors</label><description>Carriers of this gene possess infrared sensors, allowing them to see clearly in the dark. They suffer no penalties to work speed or movement in darkness, and gain improved accuracy over long range.</description><selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight><unlockable>false</unlockable><iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_InfraredSensors</iconPath><displayOrderInCategory>1007</displayOrderInCategory><statFactors><ShootingAccuracyFactor_Medium>1.1</ShootingAccuracyFactor_Medium><ShootingAccuracyFactor_Long>1.05</ShootingAccuracyFactor_Long></statFactors><ignoreDarkness>true</ignoreDarkness><modExtensions><li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension"><backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathEndogenes><backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_EvolutionBG</backgroundPathXenogenes></li></modExtensions></VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef></value></li></nomatch></Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional"><xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_AcidBurstSack"]</xpath><nomatch><li Class="PatchOperationAdd"><xpath>/Defs</xpath><value><VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_MutationGene"><defName>VRE_AcidBurstSack</defName><label>acid burstsack</label><description>Carriers of this gene possess an acid burstsack, which triggers an explosive release of corrosive acid when they take a severe hit. This explosion affects everything within a wide radius, causing ongoing damage to those caught in the blast.</description><iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_AcidBurstsack</iconPath><unlockable>false</unlockable><displayOrderInCategory>1006</displayOrderInCategory><selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight><exclusionTags><li>Tail</li></exclusionTags><modExtensions><li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension"><backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathEndogenes><backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathXenogenes><hediffToWholeBody>VRE_AcidBurstSack</hediffToWholeBody></li></modExtensions></VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef></value></li></nomatch></Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional"><xpath>/Defs/VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef[defName="VRE_SolidGreyMatter"]</xpath><nomatch><li Class="PatchOperationAdd"><xpath>/Defs</xpath><value><VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef ParentName="VRE_MutationGene"><defName>VRE_SolidGreyMatter</defName><label>solid grey matter</label><description>Carriers of this gene have solidified grey matter, resulting in a complete inability to learn new skills. They experience accelerated skill loss, which affects them even at lower skill levels.</description><iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_SolidGreymatter</iconPath><unlockable>false</unlockable><selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight><displayOrderInCategory>1007</displayOrderInCategory><statFactors><GlobalLearningFactor>0</GlobalLearningFactor></statFactors><exclusionTags><li>InsectorBrain</li></exclusionTags><customEffectDescriptions><li>Global skill loss multiplier: x2.</li><li>Skill loss applies even below level 10.</li></customEffectDescriptions><symbolPack><prefixSymbols><li><symbol>thag</symbol></li><li><symbol>grunt</symbol></li><li><symbol>stupid</symbol></li><li><symbol>dull</symbol></li><li><symbol>dumb</symbol></li></prefixSymbols></symbolPack><modExtensions><li Class="VanillaGenesExpanded.GeneExtension"><backgroundPathEndogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathEndogenes><backgroundPathXenogenes>UI/Icons/Genes/VRE_MutationBG</backgroundPathXenogenes><globalSkillLossMultiplier>2</globalSkillLossMultiplier><skillDegradation>true</skillDegradation></li></modExtensions></VanillaRacesExpandedInsector.GenelineGeneDef></value></li></nomatch></Operation>
